{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.WhiteheadLowerRate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.WhiteheadLowerRate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.WhiteheadMajorantRate","lean:module:QOU.Knot.CatalanValueBounds"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.lowerRate_of_lemma4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.lowerRate_of_lemma4","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L141-L210","doc":"**Nothing is lost by the narrowing**: van der Veen's Lemma 4 implies the\none-sided rate.  So any discharge of `VdVWhiteheadLemma4` still yields the\nvolume conjecture through `whiteheadLink_volume_of_lowerRate`, while an\nattack may now target the weaker `WhiteheadLinkLowerRate` instead.\n\nThe `N^p` factor costs `p·(2π/N)·log N → 0`, which is why a *polynomial*\nphase cost is invisible at this scale — the content of Lemma 4 is that the\ncost is not exponential. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.whiteheadLink_volume_of_lowerRate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.whiteheadLink_volume_of_lowerRate","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L101-L139","doc":"**The Whitehead-link volume conjecture from the one-sided rate**\n(sorry-free given the class).\n\n`(2π/N)·log‖J_N(W)‖ → Vol(𝓑₃)/2 = 4G = Vol(L5a1)`.\n\nThe upper half is unconditional — the triangle bound\n`norm_whiteheadLinkKashaev_le` against the sorry-free majorant rate\n`tendsto_log_whiteheadLinkMajorant_vol`.  Only the lower half uses the\nclass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.eventually_one_lt_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.eventually_one_lt_norm","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L75-L99","doc":"Under the lower rate, `‖J_N‖ > 1` eventually — so `Real.log`'s junk value\nat `0` never bites in the upper comparison below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate.lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate.lower","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L71-L71","doc":"For every `ε > 0`, eventually `4G − ε ≤ (2π/N)·log‖J_N‖`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate.mk","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.WhiteheadLinkLowerRate","kind":"class","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L62-L73","doc":"**The one-sided rate the volume conjecture actually needs.**\n\nStrictly weaker than `VdVWhiteheadLemma4` (see `lowerRate_of_lemma4`): it\nmentions neither the majorant nor a polynomial exponent, only that the\nscaled log-modulus is not asymptotically below the volume.\n\nOPEN: no instance exists in this corpus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.vol_borromean_half_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.FigureEightVolume.vol_borromean_half_pos","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/WhiteheadLowerRate.lean#L54-L60","doc":"The volume target is positive — needed to turn the lower rate into\npositivity of `‖J_N‖`, since `Real.log` is junk-valued at `0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}